e-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><ol start=\"3\"><li><p><strong>That’s it!</strong> Jump into my thread to say hi, and if you have any issues, check out <a href=\"https://support.substack.com/hc/en-us/sections/360007461791-Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Substack’s FAQ</a>.</p></li></ol><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/chat&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Join chat&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/chat\"><span>Join chat</span></a></p><p></p><div><hr></div><p>I’ve already started my first chat thread so come on over and say hello!</p>","text":"Today I’m announcing a brand new addition to my Substack publication: the The Frontier Psychiatrists subscriber chat.\n\nThis is a conversation space in the Substack app that I set up exclusively for my subscribers — kind of like a group chat or live hangout. I’ll post short prompts, thoughts, and updates that come my way, and you can jump into the discussion. It’s also a great way to ask you what pieces you want me to write next, and interact with the other hip cool people who are completely into this kind of sassy publication.\n\nTo join our chat, you’ll need to download the Substack app (messages are sent via the app, not email). Turn on push notifications so you don’t miss a chance to join conversation as it happens.\n\nHow to get started\n\n• Download the app by clicking this link or the button below. Chat is only on iOS for now, but chat is coming to the Android app soon.\n\nGet app\n\n• Open the app and tap the Chat icon. It looks like two bubbles in the bottom bar, and you’ll see a row for my chat inside.\n\n• That’s it! Jump into my thread to say hi, and if you have any issues, check out Substack’s FAQ .\n\nJoin chat\n\nI’ve already started my first chat thread so come on over and say hello!"}